========== SimBEV Dataset ==========

"SimBEV Dataset" means the collection of simulated sensor data, ground truth
annotations, and associated metadata generated using the Software and
distributed by the Developer (e.g., via the project website or other official
distribution channels), as distinct from the Software itself.

Unless specifically labeled otherwise, the SimBEV Dataset is provided to you
under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0
